 ccset-sett:\n    prefix: CCSET_SETT_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^CCSET-SETT-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match CCSET-SETT-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per client configuration setting, naming the client application that declares it. Declare the setting — key, value type and default — never its value on a particular machine: the value comes from the app configuration resources or this install\'s persisted overrides. Typical keys: api.baseUrl, app.environment, app.updateChannel, device.options, feature.<name>."\n  cmpnt-comp:\n    prefix: CMPNT_COMP_\n    subsection-types:\n      cmpvd:\n        max-count: 1\n      cmpmt:\n        max-count: 1\n      cmpsp:\n        max-count: 1\n      cmppf:\n        max-count: 1\n      cmpdp:\n        max-count: 1\n      coco:\n        max-count: 1\n      cc:\n        max-count: 1\n      cori:\n        max-count: 1\n      codo-docs-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n      cmif-inte-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n      colien:\n        max-count: 1\n      coreen-resp-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^CMPNT-COMP-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match CMPNT-COMP-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per cataloged component.\n  dsset-sett:\n    prefix: DSSET_SETT_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^DSSET-SETT-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match DSSET-SETT-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per device setting. Declare the setting — key, value type and default — never the user\'s chosen value: that lives in the device-local store. Typical keys: window.layout, editor.fontSize, recent.files, cache.sizeLimit."\n  evcen-item:\n    prefix: EVCEN_ITEM_\n    subsection-types:\n      evces:\n        max-count: 1\n      evcep:\n        max-count: 1\n      evceg:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^EVCEN-ITEM-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match EVCEN-ITEM-xxx\n    description: Add one entry