pe\n        description: "Internal team, external firm, regulatory body"\n      - fieldname: estimatedDuration\n        description: Expected duration of the audit engagement\n  saefu-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: expectedDeliverables\n        description: "Audit report, remediation plan, certification, attestation"\n      - fieldname: remediationTimeline\n        description: Expected timeline for addressing findings\n      - fieldname: responsibleParty\n        description: Team or individual responsible for coordinating the audit\n      - fieldname: notes\n        description: Additional audit requirement notes\n  csvnd-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: preferredVendors\n        description: "Strategically aligned vendors, e.g. AWS, Confluent, Elastic"\n      - fieldname: prohibitedVendors\n        description: "Vendors excluded for compliance, legal, or strategic reasons"\n      - fieldname: stackDeviationProcess\n        description: How to request approval for off-stack choices\n  csgov-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: governanceModel\n        description: "How component decisions are made — Architecture Review Board, tech leads, etc."\n      - fieldname: governanceFrequency\n        description: "How often the component portfolio is reviewed, e.g. quarterly, biannually"\n      - fieldname: evaluationCadence\n        description: How often new/existing components are formally evaluated\n  csprt-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: portfolioVisibility\n        description: "Where the component catalog is published — wiki, CMDB, internal portal"\n      - fieldname: componentRegistryUrl\n        description: Link to the authoritative component catalog\n      - fieldname: maxComponentOverlap\n        description: "Maximum number of components for the same purpose, e.g. 2 DB engines"\n      - fieldname: consolidationTargets\n        description: Components targeted for elimination or merger\n  cspol-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: openSourcePolicy\n        description: "Permitted licenses, contribution policy, CLA stance"\n      - fieldname: securityBaselineRequirement\n        description: Minimum security requirements all components must meet\n      - fieldname: complianceBaselineRequirement\n        description: Minimum compliance certifications required for all components\n      - fieldname: vendorDiversityGoal\n        description: Strategy to avoid over-reliance on a single vendor\n      - fieldname: sunsetPolicy\n        description: "How end-of-life components are retired — timeline, migration support"\n  cspln-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: pilotProcessDescription\n        description: How new components are piloted before full adoption\n      - fieldname: totalPortfolioBudget\n        description: Annual budget ceiling for all component costs\n  rgums-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: scope\n        description: ProjectLevel / DivisionLevel / EnterpriseWide\n      - fieldname: targetPercentage\n        description: Target percentage of reuse for this category\n      - fieldname: currentPercentage\n        description: Measured current reuse percentage\n      - fieldname: measurementMethod\n        description: "How reuse % is measured — code analysis, component registry, survey"\n      - fieldname: measurementFrequency\n        description: "How often reuse is measured, e.g. sprint, quarterly, release"\n  rgugv-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: priority\n        description: Qualitative priority band.\n      - fieldname: targetDate\n        description: When this goal should be achieved\n      - fieldname: owner\n        description: Person or team responsible for driving this goal\n  rgenb-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: blockers\n        description: What prevents higher reuse today\n      - fieldname: enablers\n        description: Actions or investments needed to reach the target\n      - fieldname: reusableAssets\n        description: "Specific components, libraries, or services to be reused"\n  evces-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: weight\n        description: Relative importance as percentage of total score\n      - fieldname: scoringScale\n        description: "Scale used, e.g. 1-5, 1-10, Pass/Fail"\n      - fieldname: minimumThreshold\n        description: "Minimum acceptable score, e.g. 3 out of 5"\n      - fieldname: eliminatory\n        description: "Yes / No — does failing this criterion disqualify the component?"\n  evcep-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: evidenceRequired\n        description: "What proof is needed — benchmark report, vendor attestation, demo"\n      - fieldname: evaluationMethod\n        description: ProofOfConcept / ReferenceCheck / DocumentReview / LoadTest\n      - fieldname: evaluator\n        description: "Who performs this evaluation — architect, security, procurement"\n      - fieldname: evaluationDuration\n        description: Expected time to complete this evaluation\n  evceg-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: scoringGuidelineLow\n        description: What a lowest-tier score looks like\n      - fieldname: scoringGuidelineMid\n        description: What a mid-tier score looks like\n      - fieldname: scoringGuidelineHigh\n        description: What the highest score looks like\n      - fieldname: applicableTo\n        description: Which component categories this criterion applies to\n  cmpvd-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: version\n        description: Current version in use or targeted\n      - fieldname: purpose\n        description: Why this component is needed in business terms\n      - fieldname: vendorName\n        description: Company or organization behind the component\n      - fieldname: vendorStability\n        description: "Financial health, market position, acquisition risk"\n  cmpmt-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: maturityLevel\n        description: Emerging / Growing / Mature / Declining / EndOfLife\n      - fieldname: communitySize\n       