al\n        description: Max time to acknowledge a P1/critical incident\n      - fieldname: slaResolutionCritical\n        description: Max time to resolve or workaround a P1 incident\n  creo-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: patchCadence\n        description: "How quickly patches are applied, e.g. Critical: 24h, Normal: 14d"\n      - fieldname: securityVulnProcess\n        description: Steps from CVE disclosure to remediation\n      - fieldname: securityScanFrequency\n        description: How often dependency/vulnerability scans run\n      - fieldname: updateStrategy\n        description: BlueGreen / Rolling / Canary / MaintenanceWindow\n      - fieldname: changeApprovalProcess\n        description: Who approves upgrades and configuration changes\n      - fieldname: monitoringOwner\n        description: Who maintains dashboards and alerts\n  creg-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: knowledgeBaseLocation\n        description: "Where runbooks, FAQs, and tribal knowledge are stored"\n      - fieldname: budgetAllocationAnnual\n        description: Budget allocated for this component — license + ops + training\n      - fieldname: reviewFrequency\n        description: "How often the component is formally reviewed — quarterly, annually"\n      - fieldname: capacityPlanningOwner\n        description: Who monitors usage and plans for growth\n  rdec-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: versionConstraint\n        description: "Pinned / Range / Minimum, e.g. >=3.2 <4.0"\n      - fieldname: criticality\n        description: Impact if unavailable.\n      - fieldname: purpose\n        description: Why this dependency exists\n  rdes-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: startupOrder\n        description: Boot sequence priority (1 = first)\n      - fieldname: startupTimeout\n        description: Max wait time before declaring startup failure\n      - fieldname: healthCheckMethod\n        description: "How to verify this dependency is healthy — endpoint, ping, query"\n      - fieldname: healthCheckInterval\n        description: "How often health is verified, e.g. 30s"\n  rder-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: failoverBehavior\n        description: GracefulDegradation / CircuitBreaker / Retry / FailFast\n      - fieldname: fallbackComponent\n        description: What to use if this dependency fails or is unavailable\n      - fieldname: cacheStrategy\n        description: How responses/data from this dependency are cached\n  rdei-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: dataFlowDirection\n        description: ReadOnly / WriteOnly / Bidirectional / EventDriven\n      - fieldname: networkRequired\n        description: Local / LAN / Internet — and impact of network partition\n      - fieldname: latencyTolerance\n        description: Max acceptable latency to this dependency\n  rudeenri-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: transitiveRisk\n        description: Key risks from this dependency\'s own dependencies\n      - fieldname: compatibilityMatrix\n        description: Known incompatibilities with other components in our stack\n  mdec-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: dependencyType\n        description: BuildTime / TestOnly / DevOnly / Tooling\n      - fieldname: criticality\n        description: Impact if update breaks.\n      - fieldname: purpose\n        description: Why this maintenance dependency exists\n  mdeu-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: updateStrategy\n        description: "How dependency updates are adopted — auto, manual review, staged"\n      - fieldname: updateFrequency\n        description: "How often we update this dependency — weekly, monthly, quarterly"\n      - fieldname: coordinatedUpdateSequence\n        description: Order in which related components must be updated together\n      - fieldname: breakingChangePolicy\n        description: "How breaking changes are handled — pin version, adapt, delay"\n  mder-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: compatibilityMatrix\n        description: Known incompatibilities with other components in our stack\n      - fieldname: alternative\n        description: Replacement if this dependency is abandoned or EOL\n      - fieldname: transitiveRisk\n        description: Key risks from this dependency\'s own dependencies\n      - fieldname: securityPatchSla\n        description: "How quickly security patches must be applied, e.g. Critical: 24h"\n  cred-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: riskDescription\n        description: Detailed explanation of the risk scenario\n      - fieldname: riskCategory\n        description: Technical / Vendor / Security / Compliance / Operational / Financial\n  crea-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: probability\n        description: Qualitative likelihood band for this component risk.\n      - fieldname: impact\n        description: Qualitative consequence band if the risk lands.\n      - fieldname: riskScore\n        description: Calculated score (probability × impact)\n      - fieldname: riskTrend\n        description: Increasing / Stable / Decreasing — direction since last review\n  coriende-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: detectionMethod\n        description: How we would know this risk is materializing\n      - fieldname: earlyWarningIndicators\n        description: Metrics or signals that precede this risk event\n      - fieldname: monitoringMechanism\n        description: "Dashboards, alerts, or scans that track this risk"\n  crem-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: mitigationStrategy\n        description: Actions to reduce probability or impact\n      - fieldname: mitigationStatus\n        description: NotStarted / InProgress / Implemented / Verified\n      - fieldname: mitigationCost\n        description: Budget required to implement mitigation\n      - fieldname: residualRisk\n        description: Risk level remaining after mitigation.\n      - fieldname: contingencyTrigger\n        description: "Condition activating the contingency plan, e.g. No release for 12 months"\n  coriengo-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: riskOwner\n        description: Person accountable for managing this risk\n      - fieldname: reviewFrequency\n        description: How often this risk is reassessed\n      - fieldname: relatedRisks\n        description: "Other component risks that correlate or cascade — risk section ids (CMRS-RISK-…), comma-separated"\n      - fieldname: acceptanceCriteria\n        description: Under what conditions is this risk formally accepted\n  cper-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: riskRef\n        description: The component risk this plan addresses — a risk section id (CMRS-RISK-…)\n      - fieldname: componentRef\n        description: The component this plan covers — a component section id (CMPNT-COMP-…)\n  cpea-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: triggerDetection\n        description: "How the trigger is detected — alert, manual report, monitoring"\n      - fieldname: immediateActions\n        description: First steps within minutes of trigger (containment)\n      - fieldname: recoveryActions\n        description: Steps to restore full operation\n  coplenre-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: responsibleParty\n        description: Primary person/team who executes this plan\n      - fieldname: supportTeams\n        description: Additional teams involved in execution\n      - fieldname: targetRecoveryTime\n        description: Maximum acceptable downtime\n      - fieldname: targetRecoveryPoint\n        description: Maximum acceptable data loss window\n  cpec-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: communicationPlan\n        description: "Who is notified, how, and in what order"\n      - fieldname: customerCommunication\n        description: External messaging template or process\n  cpet-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: testingFrequency\n        description: "How often this plan is tested — quarterly, annually"\n      - fieldname: lastTestedDate\n        description: When this plan was last exercised\n      - fieldname: lastTestResult\n        description: Pass / Fail and key findings from last test\n      - fieldname: dependencies\n        description: "What this plan requires to execute — tools, access, backups"\n      - fieldname: estimatedCost\n        description: Estimated cost of executing this contingency\n      - fieldname: priority\n        description: Relative priority if multiple plans compete for resources\n      - fieldname: fallbackPlan\n        description: What to do if this contingency plan itself fails\n      - fieldname: documentLocation\n        description: Where the detailed step-by-step runbook is stored\n  teen-tech-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: architectureMaturity\n        description: TOGAF maturity level or equivalent\n      - fieldname: cloudStrategy\n        description: "Cloud-first, hybrid, on-premises, multi-cloud"\n      - fieldname: primaryCloudProvider\n        description: "AWS, Azure, GCP, private cloud, none"\n  teengo-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: secondaryCloudProviders\n        description: Additional or fallback cloud providers in use\n      - fieldname: technologyGovernance\n        description: How technology decisions are governed\n  teenst-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: preferredLanguages\n        description: Mandated or preferred programming languages\n      - fieldname: preferredFrameworks\n        description: Mandated or preferred frameworks\n      - fieldname: preferredDatabases\n        description: Mandated or preferred database platforms\n      - fieldname: messagingPlatforms\n        description: Enterprise messaging/queue platforms\n      - fieldname: integrationPlatforms\n        description: "ESB, API gateway, iPaaS solutions"\n  tes-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: securityFramework\n        description: "NIST, ISO 27001, SOC2, CIS — security framework used"\n      - fieldname: complianceRequirements\n        description: "GDPR, HIPAA, PCI-DSS, SOX, industry-specific"\n      - f