x: BTCEN_BUIL_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      btcen-buil:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per build tool.\n  ccset-sett-lst:\n    prefix: CCSET_SETT_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      ccset-sett:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: "Add one entry per client configuration setting, naming the client application that declares it. Declare the setting — key, value type and default — never its value on a particular machine: the value comes from the app configuration resources or this install\'s persisted overrides. Typical keys: api.baseUrl, app.environment, app.updateChannel, device.options, feature.<name>."\n  daatt-attr-lst:\n    prefix: DAATT_ATTR_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      daatt-attr:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per data attribute.\n  daent-enti-lst:\n    prefix: DAENT_ENTI_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      daent-enti:\n        max-count: infinite\n        min-count: 1\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per data entity.\n  dataa-cons-lst:\n    prefix: DATAA_CONS_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      dataa-cons:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per attribute constraint.\n  dclse-item-lst:\n    prefix: DCLSE_ITEM_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      dclse-item:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per data classification level.\n  desig-desi-lst:\n    prefix: DESIG_DESI_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      desig-desi:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per design foundation.\n  displ-disp-lst:\n    prefix: DISPL_DISP_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      displ-disp:\n        max-count: infinite\n    