max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per key attribute.\n  keatt-refe-ref:\n    prefix: KEATT_REFE_REF\n    description: The resolved link to the entity a foreign key points at.\n  lgfls-logi-lst:\n    prefix: LGFLS_LOGI_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      lgfls-logi:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per login flow step.\n  migtg-targ-lst:\n    prefix: MIGTG_TARG_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      migtg-targ:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per data source / schema pair that migration artifacts apply to. Every artifact in 7.4.2 names one of these targets.\n  mnsst-step-lst:\n    prefix: MNSST_STEP_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      mnsst-step:\n        max-count: infinite\n        min-count: 1\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per numbered step.\n  msgke-mkey-lst:\n    prefix: MSGKE_MKEY_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      msgke-mkey:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per message key (author-once copy string).\n  msglv-locv-lst:\n    prefix: MSGLV_LOCV_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      msglv-locv:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per non-default locale.\n  ntfch-chan-lst:\n    prefix: NTFCH_CHAN_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      ntfch-chan:\n        max-count: infinite\n        min-count: 1\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Define each notification channel.\n  ntfty-noti-lst:\n    prefix: NTFTY_NOTI_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      ntfty-noti:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Define each notification type.\n  parti-part-lst:\n    prefix: PARTI_PART_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      parti-part:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per participating entity.\n  plgen-prog-lst:\n    prefix: PLGEN_PROG_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      plgen-prog:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per programming language.\n  qlstd-qual-lst:\n    prefix: QLSTD_QUAL_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      qlstd-qual:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per quality standard.\n  relat-rela-lst:\n    prefix: RELAT_RELA_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      relat-rela:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per relationship attribute.\n  rlcmb-comb-lst:\n    prefix: RLCMB_COMB_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      rlcmb-comb:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per role combination rule.\n  rlinh-inhe-lst:\n    prefix: RLINH_INHE_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      rlinh-inhe:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per role inheritance relationship.\n  rsfde-fldd-lst:\n    prefix: RSFDE_FLDD_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      rsfde-fldd:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per field-level detail the error arm may report.\n  saclc-serv-lst:\n    prefix: SACLC_SERV_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      saclc-serv:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per service-account lifecycle entry.\n  scmst-step-lst:\n    prefix: SCMST_STEP_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      scmst-step:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per versioned migration artifact.\n  scnry-scen-lst:\n    prefix: SCNRY_SCEN_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      scnry-scen:\n        max-count: infinite\n        min-count: 1\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per key scenario.\n  scnst-step-lst:\n    prefix: SCNST_STEP_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      scnst-step:\n        max-count: infinite\n        min-count: 1\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: "Add one entry per main-flow step, in order."\n  scrac-item-lst:\n    prefix: SCRAC_ITEM_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      scrac-item:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per screen action.\n  screl-elem-lst:\n    prefix: SCREL_ELEM_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      screl-elem:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per screen element.\n  scren-item-lst:\n    prefix: SCREN_ITEM_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      scren-item:\n        max-count: infinite\n        min-count: 1\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per screen.\n  scrsc-item-lst:\n    prefix: SCRSC_ITEM_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      scrsc-item:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per screen section.\n  scrst-item-lst:\n    prefix: SCRST_ITEM_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      scrst-item:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per screen state.\n  scset-sett-lst:\n    prefix: SCSET_SETT_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      scset-sett:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: "Add one entry per server configuration setting **this application owns** — a setting whose key you invent. Declare the setting: key, value type, default, the source key it is read from, whether it carries a secret, and whether narrower scopes may shadow it. Never write the value: it is supplied per deployment, and a secret-bearing setting declares only its presence and shape, never its content. Typical keys: server.host, server.port, server.isolateCount, log.level, database.migrationsDirectory, tls.privateKey, jwt.rsaPrivateKey. This list is the only place a secret may be declared: the security, encryption, key-management and audit-sink policy sections name their own settings and carry values only, so a credential they need — a remote log sink password, a KMS access key — is authored here as its own entry."\n  shlcp-shar-lst:\n    prefix: SHLCP_SHAR_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      shlcp-shar:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per shared library.\n  svcst-step-lst:\n    prefix: SVCST_STEP_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      svcst-step:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: "Fill this in only where the step reaches the server. Add one entry per thing that has to happen to assemble the request, to apply the response, or to surface an error — in the order it happens, each entry saying which of the three it belongs to."\n  svope-oper-lst:\n    prefix: SVOPE_OPER_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      svope-oper:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per operation the system answers.\n  svopm-reqm-lst:\n    prefix: SVOPM_REQM_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      svopm-reqm:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per member of the request shape.\n  svopm-resm-lst:\n    prefix: SVOPM_RESM_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      svopm-resm:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per member of the success payload. Leave empty for an operation that returns nothing but success or error.\n  tgplt-targ-lst:\n    prefix: TGPLT_TARG_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      tgplt-targ:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per target platform.\n  uicom-comp-lst:\n    prefix: UICOM_COMP_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      uicom-comp:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per catalog component.\n  ultre-item-lst:\n    prefix: ULTRE_ITEM_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      ultre-item:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per user-lifecycle transition entry.\n  usate-item-lst:\n    prefix: USATE_ITEM_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      usate-item:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per user-attribute entry.\n  uscdf-item-lst:\n    prefix: USCDF_ITEM_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      uscdf-item:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per user-category definition.\n  usset-sett-lst:\n    prefix: USSET_SETT_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      usset-sett:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: "Add one entry per user setting. Declare the setting — key, value type and default — never the user\'s chosen value: that is persisted per user on the server. Typical keys: ui.theme, ui.language, ui.country, notifications.<channel>.enabled, list.pageSize."\n  acen-acto-lst:\n    prefix: ACEN_ACTO_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      acen-acto:\n        max-count: infinite\n        min-count: 1\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per actor.\n  acgo-goal-lst:\n    prefix: ACGO_GOAL_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      acgo-goal:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entr