f this section must match ENRLE-ITEM-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per entity relationship.\n  ercen-code:\n    prefix: ERCEN_CODE_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^ERCEN-CODE-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match ERCEN-CODE-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per shared application error code.\n  erhaco-erro:\n    prefix: ERHACO_ERRO\n    format: erhaco-erro-form\n    description: "The stance errors are written from, before the concrete categories below."\n  etets-endt:\n    prefix: ETETS_ENDT_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^ETETS-ENDT-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match ETETS-ENDT-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per end-to-end test scenario.\n  exten-exte:\n    prefix: EXTEN_EXTE_\n    subsection-types:\n      exten-resu:\n        max-count: 1\n      extst-step-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^EXTEN-EXTE-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match EXTEN-EXTE-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per extension flow.\n  extst-step:\n    prefix: EXTST_STEP_\n    subsection-types:\n      svcst-step-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^EXTST-STEP-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match EXTST-STEP-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per extension step.\n  gbrlx-glob:\n    prefix: GBRLX_GLOB_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^GBRLX-GLOB-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match GBRLX-GLOB-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per global role exclusion.\n  hndre-hand:\n    prefix: HNDRE_HAND_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^HNDRE-HAND-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match HNDRE-HAND-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per handling requirement.\n  ia-glob-lst:\n    prefix: IA_GLOB_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      ia-glob:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per global entry point.\n  idtam-attr:\n    prefix: IDTAM_ATTR_\n    subsection-types:\n      iamet:\n        max-count: 1\n      iames:\n        max-count: 1\n      iameg:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^IDTAM-ATTR-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match IDTAM-ATTR-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per identity-attribute mapping.\n  idtpv-iden:\n    prefix: IDTPV_IDEN_\n    subsection-types:\n      idprde-deta-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n      idpren-endp-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n      idprma:\n        max-count: 1\n      idprtr:\n        max-count: 1\n      idprse:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^IDTPV-IDEN-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match IDTPV-IDEN-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per identity-provider entry.\n  idtsr-iden:\n    prefix: IDTSR_IDEN_\n    subsection-types:\n      idsoenco:\n        max-count: 1\n      isel:\n        max-count: 1\n      isem:\n        max-count: 1\n      iseo:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^IDTSR-IDEN-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match IDTSR-IDEN-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per identifier source.\n  keatt-keya:\n    prefix: KEATT_KEYA_\n    subsection-types:\n      keagn:\n        max-count: 1\n      kearf:\n        max-count: 1\n      keagv:\n        max-count: 1\n      keatt-refe-ref:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^KEATT-KEYA-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match KEATT-KEYA-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per key attribute.\n  lgfls-logi:\n    prefix: LGFLS_LOGI_\n    subsection-types:\n      lfsev:\n        max-count: 1\n      lfseb:\n        max-count: 1\n      lfsep:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^LGFLS-LOGI-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match LGFLS-LOGI-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per login flow step.\n  mc-mfad-lst:\n    prefix: MC_MFAD_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      mc-mfad:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per MFA method definition.\n  meanob-metr:\n    prefix: MEANOB_METR\n    format: meanob-metr-form\n    description: "Which telemetry signals are collected at all, in what format, and at what"\n  migtg-targ:\n    prefix: MIGTG_TARG_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^MIGTG-TARG-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match MIGTG-TARG-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per data source / schema pair that migration artifacts apply to. Every artifact in 7.4.2 names one of these targets.\n  mnsst-step:\n    prefix: MNSST_STEP_\n    subsection-types:\n      svcst-step-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^MNSST-STEP-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match MNSST-STEP-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per numbered step.\n  monito-moni:\n    prefix: MONITO_MONI\n    format: monito-moni-form\n    description: "The monitoring posture as a whole — the strategy, the platforms it runs"\n  msgke-mkey:\n    prefix: MSGKE_MKEY_\n    subsection-types:\n      msglv-locv-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^MSGKE-MKEY-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match MSGKE-MKEY-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per message key (author-once copy string).\n  msglv-locv:\n    prefix: MSGLV_LOCV_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^MSGLV-LOCV-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match MSGLV-LOCV-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per non-default locale.\n  ntfch-chan:\n    prefix: NTFCH_CHAN_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^NTFCH-CHAN-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match NTFCH-CHAN-xxx\n    description: Define each notification channel.\n  ntfty-noti:\n    prefix: NTFTY_NOTI_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^NTFTY-NOTI-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match NTFTY-NOTI-xxx\n    description: Define each notification type.\n  parti-part:\n    prefix: PARTI_PART_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^PARTI-PART-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match PARTI-PART-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per participating entity.\n  pe-prot-lst:\n    prefix: PE_PROT_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      pe-prot:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per protocol.\n  plgen-prog:\n    prefix: PLGEN_PROG_\n    subsection-types:\n      plgvr:\n        max-count: 1\n      plgsk:\n        max-count: 1\n      plgus:\n        max-count: 1\n      plgqu:\n        max-count: 1\n      plgjt:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^PLGEN-PROG-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match PLGEN-PROG-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per programming language.\n  qlstd-qual:\n    prefix: QLSTD_QUAL_\n    subsection-types:\n      qsep:\n        max-count: 1\n      qsei:\n        max-count: 1\n      qsec:\n        max-count: 1\n      qsem:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^QLSTD-QUAL-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match QLSTD-QUAL-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per quality standard.\n  relat-rela:\n    prefix: RELAT_RELA_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^RELAT-RELA-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match RELAT-RELA-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per relationship attribute.\n  rlcmb-comb:\n    prefix: RLCMB_COMB_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^RLCMB-COMB-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match RLCMB-COMB-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per role combination rule.\n  rlinh-inhe:\n    prefix: RLINH_INHE_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^RLINH-INHE-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match RLINH-INHE-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per role inheritance relationship.\n  rsfde-fldd:\n    prefix: RSFDE_FLDD_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^RSFDE-FLDD-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match RSFDE-FLDD-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per field-level detail the error arm may report.\n  saclc-serv:\n    prefix: SACLC_SERV_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SACLC-SERV-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SACLC-SERV-xxx\n    format: saclc-serv-form\n    description: Add one entry per service-account lifecycle entry.\n  scmst-step:\n    prefix: SCMST_STEP_\n    subsection-types:\n      scmst-base:\n        max-count: 1\n      scmst-refd:\n        max-count: 1\n      scmst-chng:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SCMST-STEP-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SCMST-STEP-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per versioned migration artifact.\n  scnry-scen:\n    prefix: SCNRY_SCEN_\n    subsection-types:\n      scid:\n        max-count: 1\n      scco:\n        max-count: 1\n      scnst-step-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n        min-count: 1\n      alfl-alte-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n      scda:\n        max-count: 1\n      scti:\n        max-count: 1\n      scva:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SCNRY-SCEN-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SCNRY-SCEN-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per key scenario.\n  scnst-step:\n    prefix: SCNST_STEP_\n    subsection-types:\n      ssec:\n        max-count: 1\n      scstenex:\n        max-count: 1\n      svcst-step-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SCNST-STEP-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SCNST-STEP-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per main-flow step, in order."\n  scrac-item:\n    prefix: SCRAC_ITEM_\n    subsection-types:\n      saev:\n        max-count: 1\n      saec:\n        max-count: 1\n      saeb:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SCRAC-ITEM-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SCRAC-ITEM-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per screen action.\n  screl-elem:\n    prefix: SCREL_ELEM_\n    subsection-types:\n      seer:\n        max-count: 1\n      scelenla:\n        max-count: 1\n      seeb:\n        max-count: 1\n      azreq:\n        max-count: 1\n      scelenpr:\n        max-count: 1\n      scelac:\n        max-count: 1\n      sefs:\n        max-count: 1\n      sedd:\n        max-count: 1\n      elvaru-vali-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SCREL-ELEM-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SCREL-ELEM-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per screen element.\n  scren-item:\n    prefix: SCREN_ITEM_\n    subsection-types:\n      scecl:\n        max-count: 1\n      azreq:\n        max-count: 1\n      scetr:\n        max-count: 1\n      scenpr:\n        max-count: 1\n      scse:\n        max-count: 1\n      scac:\n        max-count: 1\n      scst:\n        max-count: 1\n      suce-user-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n      epnt-entr-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n      screru-resp-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SCREN-ITEM-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SCREN-ITEM-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per screen.\n  scrsc-item:\n    prefix: SCRSC_ITEM_\n    subsection-types:\n      ssel:\n        max-count: 1\n      sseb:\n        max-count: 1\n      screl-elem-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SCRSC-ITEM-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SCRSC-ITEM-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per screen section.\n  scrst-item:\n    prefix: SCRST_ITEM_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SCRST-ITEM-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SCRST-ITEM-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per screen state.\n  scset-sett:\n    prefix: SCSET_SETT_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SCSET-SETT-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SCSET-SETT-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per server configuration setting **this application owns** — a setting whose key you invent. Declare the setting: key, value type, default, the source key it is read from, whether it carries a secret, and whether narrower scopes may shadow it. Never write the value: it is supplied per deployment, and a secret-bearing setting declares only its presence and shape, never its content. Typical keys: server.host, server.port, server.isolateCount, log.level, database.migrationsDirectory, tls.privateKey, jwt.rsaPrivateKey. This list is the only place a secret may be declared: the security, encryption, key-management and audit-sink policy sections name their own settings and carry values only, so a credential they need — a remote log sink password, a KMS access key — is authored here as its own entry."\n  se-slos-lst:\n    prefix: SE_SLOS_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      se-slos:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per SLO.\n  shlcp-shar:\n    prefix: SHLCP_SHAR_\n    subsection-types:\n      slced:\n        max-count: 1\n      slcet:\n        max-count: 1\n      slceq:\n        max-count: 1\n      slceo:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SHLCP-SHAR-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SHLCP-SHAR-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per shared library.\n  so-main-lst:\n    prefix: SO_MAIN_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      so-main:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per maintenance procedure.\n  svcst-step:\n    prefix: SVCST_STEP_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SVCST-STEP-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SVCST-STEP-xxx\n    description: "Fill this in only where the step reaches the server. Add one entry per thing that has to happen to assemble the request, to apply the response, or to surface an error — in the order it happens, each entry saying which of the three it belongs to."\n  svope-oper:\n    prefix: SVOPE_OPER_\n    subsection-types:\n      azreq:\n        max-count: 1\n      svopm-reqm-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n      svopm-resm-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SVOPE-OPER-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SVOPE-OPER-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per operation the system answers.\n  svopm-reqm:\n    prefix: SVOPM_REQM_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SVOPM-REQM-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SVOPM-REQM-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per member of the request shape.\n  svopm-resm:\n    prefix: SVOPM_RESM_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SVOPM-RESM-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SVOPM-RESM-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per member of the success payload. Leave empty for an operation that returns nothing but success or error.\n  syerdi-syst:\n    prefix: SYERDI_SYST\n    format: syerdi-syst-form\n    description: How failures the user cannot correct are surfaced.\n  tgplt-targ:\n    prefix: TGPLT_TARG_\n    subsection-types:\n      tpevr:\n        max-count: 1\n      tpear:\n        max-count: 1\n      tperq:\n        max-count: 1\n      tpelc:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^TGPLT-TARG-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match TGPLT-TARG-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per target platform.\n  uicom-comp:\n    prefix: UICOM_COMP_\n    subsection-types:\n      uicom-iden:\n        max-count: 1\n      ucep:\n        max-count: 1\n      ucec:\n        max-count: 1\n      uicom-visu:\n        max-count: 1\n      uced:\n        max-count: 1\n      uces:\n        max-count: 1\n      uicoensu:\n        max-count: 1\n      uicom-inte:\n        max-count: 1\n      uceib:\n        max-count: 1\n      ucea:\n        max-count: 1\n      uicoensc:\n        max-count: 1\n      uicom-resp:\n        max-count: 1\n      uicom-ac