 capacity\n      - **Security**: IT security standards, privacy, auditing\n      **Integration Points**: All subsections feed into the ATS document.\n      Decisions must align with business requirements from the target-process\n      sections and the system overview. Security requirements coordinate with\n      the security and access model.\n  teis:\n    prefix: TEIS\n    subsection-types:\n      tecopo:\n        max-count: 1\n      ctap:\n        max-count: 1\n      tncs-tena-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n      teonpo:\n        max-count: 1\n      tbep:\n        max-count: 1\n    description: 9.4.7. Tenant Isolation.\n  tlre:\n    prefix: TLRE\n    subsection-types:\n      trcs:\n        max-count: 1\n      trcv:\n        max-count: 1\n      tlrete:\n        max-count: 1\n      tlreco:\n        max-count: 1\n    description: TLS/SSL requirements.\n  tpai:\n    prefix: TPAI\n    subsection-types:\n      tpaia:\n        max-count: 1\n      tpaic:\n        max-count: 1\n      tpail:\n        max-count: 1\n      tpaim:\n        max-count: 1\n      thpaapinai:\n        max-count: 1\n      tpaio:\n        max-count: 1\n    description: Third-party API integrations.\n  trca:\n    prefix: TRCA\n    subsection-types:\n      trcaru:\n        max-count: 1\n      trcaac:\n        max-count: 1\n      trcaco:\n        max-count: 1\n    description: Troubleshooting capabilities.\n  trcs:\n    prefix: TRCS\n    format: trcs-form\n    description: Cipher suite policy.\n  trcv:\n    prefix: TRCV\n    format: trcv-form\n    description: Certificate validation rules.\n  ucca:\n    prefix: UCCA\n    format: ucca-form\n    description: Component naming and documentation approach.\n  ucea:\n    prefix: UCEA\n    format: ucea-form\n    description: Animation behavior.\n  ucec:\n    prefix: UCEC\n    format: ucec-form\n    description: Classification details.\n  uced:\n    prefix: UCED\n    format: uced-form\n    description: Visual dimensions.\n  ucep:\n    prefix: UCEP\n    format: ucep-