month growth, e.g. 2%"\n      - fieldname: peakGrowthPeriods\n        description: "When data grows fastest, e.g. Q4, month-end"\n  dvsp-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: projectedVolumeOneYear\n        description: Expected volume in 12 months\n      - fieldname: projectedVolumeThreeYears\n        description: Expected volume in 36 months\n      - fieldname: capacityUtilization\n        description: "Percentage of storage capacity used, e.g. 72%"\n  dvsc-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: capacityConstraints\n        description: Any current or anticipated capacity issues\n      - fieldname: storageCost\n        description: "Annual cost of data storage, e.g. €250k/year"\n      - fieldname: costGrowthProjection\n        description: Expected storage cost growth\n  reposu-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: policyFrameworkExists\n        description: Yes / Partial / No\n      - fieldname: primaryRegulations\n        description: "Key regulations driving retention, e.g. GDPR, SOX, HIPAA"\n      - fieldname: defaultRetentionPeriod\n        description: "Default retention if not specified, e.g. 7 years"\n      - fieldname: policyComplianceRate\n        description: Percentage of data following retention policies\n      - fieldname: archivalSystemExists\n        description: Yes / No — whether systematic archival exists\n      - fieldname: automatedPurging\n        description: Yes / Partial / Manual — purging automation level\n      - fieldname: legalHoldProcess\n        description: Whether legal hold process is defined\n      - fieldname: retentionGaps\n        description: Number of data areas without retention policies\n      - fieldname: lastPolicyReview\n        description: When retention policies were last reviewed\n  rper-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: retentionPeriod\n        description: "How long data is retained, e.g. 7 years"\n      - fieldname: retentionTrigger\n        description: "What starts the retention clock, e.g. creation date