ity band.\n      - fieldname: knownIssues\n        description: Current problems with this integration\n  mdsu-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: mdmMaturityLevel\n        description: Level 1-5 or Initial/Managed/Defined/Measured/Optimized\n      - fieldname: mdmStrategy\n        description: Centralized / RegionalHubs / Federated / NoStrategy\n      - fieldname: mdmPlatform\n        description: Technology used for MDM if any\n      - fieldname: totalMasterDataDomains\n        description: Number of defined master data domains\n      - fieldname: goldenRecordCoverage\n        description: Percentage of master data with golden records\n      - fieldname: dataQualityInMaster\n        description: Quality level of master data\n      - fieldname: synchronizationApproach\n        description: How master data is synchronized across systems\n      - fieldname: dataMatchingCapability\n        description: Level of deduplication/matching capability\n      - fieldname: hierarchyManagement\n        description: How organizational/product hierarchies are managed\n      - fieldname: mdmGaps\n        description: Primary gaps in master data management\n  mddeq-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: recordCount\n        description: Number of master records\n      - fieldname: qualityScore\n        description: Quality of master data in this domain\n      - fieldname: duplicateRate\n        description: "Estimated duplication, e.g. 3%"\n  mddeu-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: consumingSystems\n        description: Systems that use this master data\n      - fieldname: updateFrequency\n        description: How often master data is updated\n      - fieldname: governanceLevel\n        description: Level of governance for this domain\n  mddeg-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: domainOwner\n        description: Who owns this master data domain\n      - fieldname: dataSteward\n        description: Steward responsible for data quality\n      - fieldname: knownIssues\n    