n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per dependency on another requirement.\n  rqdep-rela-ref:\n    prefix: RQDEP_RELA_REF\n    description: "The other requirement in this dependency, named by section id."\n  rqtsc-rela-ref:\n    prefix: RQTSC_RELA_REF\n    description: "The acceptance criterion this test case verifies, named by section id."\n  rqtsc-test-lst:\n    prefix: RQTSC_TEST_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      rqtsc-test:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per test case that verifies this requirement.\n  scbhv-beha-lst:\n    prefix: SCBHV_BEHA_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      scbhv-beha:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Define dynamic behaviors and interactions.\n  secrq-requ-lst:\n    prefix: SECRQ_REQU_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      secrq-requ:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per security requirement.\n  acpr-para-lst:\n    prefix: ACPR_PARA_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      acpr-para:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per parameter passed to this action.\n  orrq-requ-lst:\n    prefix: ORRQ_REQU_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      orrq-requ:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per organizational requirement.\n  rere-requ-lst:\n    prefix: RERE_REQU_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      rere-requ:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Requirement relationships.\n  terq-requ-lst:\n    prefix: TERQ_REQU_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      terq-requ:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per technical requirement.\n  ace-crit-lst:\n    prefix: ACE_CRIT_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      ace-crit:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one criterion per testable condition.\n  daenre-enti:\n    prefix: DAENRE_ENTI_\n    subsection-types:\n      daenre-rela-ref:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^DAENRE-ENTI-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match DAENRE-ENTI-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per data entity this requirement reads, creates, updates, or deletes."\n  fre-requ-lst:\n    prefix: FRE_REQU_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      fre-requ:\n        max-count: infinite\n        min-count: 1\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: "Add one entry per functional requirement. Group related requirements together. Each requirement should be atomic, testable, and have clear acceptance criteria."\n  rqbiru-rule:\n    prefix: RQBIRU_RULE_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^RQBIRU-RULE-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match RQBIRU-RULE-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per business rule that constrains or guides this requirement.\n  rqscac-acti:\n    prefix: RQSCAC_ACTI_\n    subsection-types:\n      acpr-para-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^RQSCAC-ACTI-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match RQSCAC-ACTI-xxx\n    description: Define actions available in the UI.\n  secoen-cont:\n    prefix: SECOEN_CONT_\n    subsection-types:\n      scei:\n        max-count: 1\n      scev:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SECOEN-CONT-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SECOEN-CONT-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per security control implementing this requirement.\n  sfe-fiel-lst:\n    prefix: SFE_FIEL_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      sfe-fiel:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Define each field in the UI.\n  fldvl-vali:\n    prefix: