dings and scope creep.\n  sle-soft-lst:\n    prefix: SLE_SOFT_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      sle-soft:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per software layer.\n  sre-serv-lst:\n    prefix: SRE_SERV_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      sre-serv:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per server role.\n  sse-stan-lst:\n    prefix: SSE_STAN_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      sse-stan:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per security standard.\n  stagdp-depe:\n    prefix: STAGDP_DEPE_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^STAGDP-DEPE-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match STAGDP-DEPE-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per staging dependency.\n  stagdr-driv:\n    prefix: STAGDR_DRIV_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^STAGDR-DRIV-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match STAGDR-DRIV-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per staging driver.\n  stagse-stag:\n    prefix: STAGSE_STAG_\n    subsection-types:\n      stsuid:\n        max-count: 1\n      stsuti:\n        max-count: 1\n      stsusc:\n        max-count: 1\n      stsure-reso-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n      stsude-depe-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n      stsuqu:\n        max-count: 1\n      stsust:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^STAGSE-STAG-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match STAGSE-STAG-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per stage summary.\n  stagst-cons:\n    prefix: STAGST_CONS_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^STAGST-CONS-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match STAGST-CONS-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per staging constraint.\n  stagst-keya:\n    prefix: STAGST_KEYA_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^STAGST-KEYA-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match STAGST-KEYA-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per key assumption.\n  stanin-stak:\n    prefix: STANIN_STAK_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^STANIN-STAK-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match STANIN-STAK-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per stakeholder interest.\n  stgmrs-item:\n    prefix: STGMRS_ITEM_\n    subsection-types:\n      smri:\n        max-count: 1\n      smrpi:\n        max-count: 1\n      smrm:\n        max-count: 1\n      smrc:\n        max-count: 1\n      stmirimo:\n        max-count: 1\n      smro:\n        max-count: 1\n      smrr:\n        max-count: 1\n      smrs:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^STGMRS-ITEM-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match STGMRS-ITEM-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per migration risk.\n  stgsuc-succ:\n    prefix: STGSUC_SUCC_\n    subsection-types:\n      sscem:\n        max-count: 1\n      sscev:\n        max-count: 1\n      ssces:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^STGSUC-SUCC-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match STGSUC-SUCC-xxx\n    description: A success criterion entry (form).\n  stmire-reso:\n    prefix: STMIRE_RESO_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^STMIRE-RESO-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match STMIRE-RESO-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per migration resource.\n  stsude-depe:\n    prefix: STSUDE_DEPE_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^STSUDE-DEPE-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match STSUDE-DEPE-xxx\n    description: Dependencies for stage summary.\n  stsure-reso:\n    prefix: STSURE_RESO_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^STSURE-RESO-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match STSURE-RESO-xxx\n    description: Resources for stage summary.\n  sucrre-rela:\n    prefix: SUCRRE_RELA_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SUCRRE-RELA-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SUCRRE-RELA-xxx\n    description: "Add relationship entries tracing this criterion to related goals, requirements, dependencies, and stakeholders."\n  suploc-supp:\n    prefix: SUPLOC_SUPP_\n    subsection-types:\n      slef:\n        max-count: 1\n      suloenro:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SUPLOC-SUPP-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SUPLOC-SUPP-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per supported locale.\n  sybupr-supp:\n    prefix: SYBUPR_SUPP_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SYBUPR-SUPP-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SYBUPR-SUPP-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per business process the system supports; note its role and execution frequency.\n  sybuun-busi:\n    prefix: SYBUUN_BUSI_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SYBUUN-BUSI-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SYBUUN-BUSI-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per business unit using the system; note user count and dependency level.\n  sycoan-nonf:\n    prefix: SYCOAN_NONF_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SYCOAN-NONF-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SYCOAN-NONF-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per non-financial benefit (e.g. risk reduction, agility) to weigh in the ROI case."\n  sydasc-know:\n    prefix: SYDASC_KNOW_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SYDASC-KNOW-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SYDASC-KNOW-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per data-quality issue to address; note severity and remediation approach.\n  syerco-erro:\n    prefix: SYERCO_ERRO_\n    subsection-types:\n      seceh:\n        max-count: 1\n      seceo:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SYERCO-ERRO-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SYERCO-ERRO-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per system error code.\n  syerdi-erro:\n    prefix: SYERDI_ERRO_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SYERDI-ERRO-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SYERDI-ERRO-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per error page design.\n  sykntr-crit:\n    prefix: SYKNTR_CRIT_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SYKNTR-CRIT-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SYKNTR-CRIT-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per critical knowledge area at risk of being lost when the system is retired.\n  symiri-risk:\n    prefix: SYMIRI_RISK_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SYMIRI-RISK-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SYMIRI-RISK-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per migration risk; capture probability, impact, mitigation, and contingency."\n  syrest-pred:\n    prefix: SYREST_PRED_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SYREST-PRED-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SYREST-PRED-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per predecessor system that must be replaced or addressed before this system can proceed.\n  syteas-know:\n    prefix: SYTEAS_KNOW_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SYTEAS-KNOW-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SYTEAS-KNOW-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per significant known technical issue, defect, or deficiency affecting the system."\n  syteas-secu:\n    prefix: SYTEAS_SECU_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SYTEAS-SECU-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SYTEAS-SECU-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per security vulnerability or compliance gap; note severity and remediation status.\n  sytore-syst:\n    prefix: SYTORE_SYST_\n    subsection-types:\n      sytore-iden:\n        max-count: 1\n      strep:\n        max-count: 1\n      strev:\n        max-count: 1\n      syteas:\n        max-count: 1\n      sybucr:\n        max-count: 1\n      syrest:\n        max-count: 1\n      sydasc:\n        max-count: 1\n      resyde-depe-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n      syusim:\n        max-count: 1\n      sycoan:\n        max-count: 1\n      symipl:\n        max-count: 1\n      sykntr:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SYTORE-SYST-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SYTORE-SYST-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per legacy system targeted for replacement; each entry captures its full technical, business, and migration assessment."\n  tabade-tabb:\n    prefix: TABADE_TABB_\n    subsection-types:\n      tbdeb:\n        max-count: 1\n      tbdel:\n        max-count: 1\n      tie-tabs-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n        min-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^TABADE-TABB-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match TABADE-TABB-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per tab bar or segmented control.\n  tedava-vari:\n    prefix: TEDAVA_VARI_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^TEDAVA-VARI-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match TEDAVA-VARI-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per variation.\n  teenne-devo:\n    prefix: TEENNE_DEVO_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^TEENNE-DEVO-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match TEENNE-DEVO-xxx\n    description: "List DevOps and deployment standards: CI/CD tooling, release process, and environment promotion rules."\n  teenne-obse:\n    prefix: TEENNE_OBSE_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^TEENNE-OBSE-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match TEENNE-OBSE-xxx\n    description: "List observability requirements: metrics, logging, tracing, alerting standards, and required monitoring platforms."\n  tegots-item:\n    prefix: TEGOTS_ITEM_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^TEGOTS-ITEM-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match TEGOTS-ITEM-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per test case covering procedure, expected result, and status for this goal."\n  tescno-note:\n    prefix: TESCNO_NOTE_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^TESCNO-NOTE-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match TESCNO-NOTE-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per test-scenario note.\n  tge-goal-lst:\n    prefix: TGE_GOAL_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      tge-goal:\n        max-count: infinite\n        min-count: 1\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: "Add one entry per technical goal. Cover key quality attributes: performance, scalability, reliability, security, usability, maintainability."\n  thpaco-thir:\n    prefix: THPACO_THIR_\n    subsection-types:\n      tpcec:\n        max-count: 1\n      tpcei:\n        max-count: 1\n      tpcet:\n        max-count: 1\n      tpces:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^THPACO-THIR-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match THPACO-THIR-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per third-party software product.\n  thpali-thir:\n    prefix: THPALI_THIR_\n    subsection-types:\n      tplee:\n        max-count: 1\n      tplel:\n        max-count: 1\n      tpler:\n        max-count: 1\n      tpleu:\n        max-count: 1\n      tplem:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^THPALI-THIR-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match THPALI-THIR-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per third-party library.\n  tie-tabs-lst:\n    prefix: TIE_TABS_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      tie-tabs:\n        max-count: infinite\n        min-count: 1\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per tab item in the tab bar.\n  tme-trai-lst:\n    prefix: TME_TRAI_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      tme-trai:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per training module.\n  trcoch-chan:\n    prefix: TRCOCH_CHAN_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^TRCOCH-CHAN-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match TRCOCH-CHAN-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per communication channel describing its purpose, ownership, and accessibility."\n  trespa-esca:\n    prefix: TRESPA_ESCA_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^TRESPA-ESCA-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match TRESPA-ESCA-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per escalation path describing its levels, criteria, and response-time targets."\n  trspre-supp:\n    prefix: TRSPRE_SUPP_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^TRSPRE-SUPP-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match TRSPRE-SUPP-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per support resource describing its type, coverage, capacity, and ownership."\n  tse-tech-lst:\n    prefix: TSE_TECH_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      tse-tech:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: "List technology standards the solution must follow, with their scope, mandate level, and compliance expectations."\n  tve-vend-lst:\n    prefix: TVE_VEND_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      tve-vend:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per translation vendor.\n  uatsst-test:\n    prefix: UATSST_TEST_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^UATSST-TEST-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match UATSST-TEST-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per user-acceptance test step.\n  uce-user-lst:\n    prefix: UCE_USER_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      uce-user:\n        max-count: infinite\n        min-count: 1\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: "Add one entry per distinct category of user, distinguished by role, access level, or interaction pattern with the system."\n  unp-pref-lst:\n    prefix: UNP_PREF_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      unp-pref:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per user notification-preference profile.\n  upd-repr-lst:\n    prefix: UPD_REPR_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      upd-repr:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: "Add quotes that capture how this persona thinks and speaks, to make the persona vivid for designers."\n  usgrim-user:\n    prefix: USGRIM_USER_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^USGRIM-USER-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match USGRIM-USER-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per user group needing special handling; note impact level and special considerations.\n  utmeit-menu:\n    prefix: UTMEIT_MENU_\n    subsection-types:\n      umiea:\n        max-count: 1\n      umieb:\n        max-count: 1\n      azreq:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^UTMEIT-MENU-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match UTMEIT-MENU-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per utility menu item.\n  utnait-item:\n    prefix: UTNAIT_ITEM_\n    subsection-types:\n      unied:\n        max-count: 1\n      azreq:\n        max-count: 1\n      unieb:\n        max-count: 1\n      utmeit-menu-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^UTNAIT-ITEM-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match UTNAIT-ITEM-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per utility navigation item.\n  vmt-mess-lst:\n    prefix: VMT_MESS_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      vmt-mess:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per validation message template.\n  vre-vpnr-lst:\n    prefix: VRE_VPNR_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      vre-vpnr:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per VPN requirement.\n  wae-acto-lst:\n    prefix: WAE_ACTO_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      wae-acto:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: "Add one entry per actor (role, system, department, external) taking part in this workflow, with their responsibilities and authorization level."\n  wae-part-ref:\n    prefix: WAE_PART_REF\n    subsection-types:\n      wse:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Steps this actor participates in.\n  wasele-serv:\n    prefix: WASELE_SERV_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^WASELE-SERV-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match WASELE-SERV-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per warranty service element.\n  wcsucr-succ:\n    prefix: WCSUCR_SUCC_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^WCSUCR-SUCC-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match WCSUCR-SUCC-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per WCAG success criterion.\n  woburu-busi:\n    prefix: WOBURU_BUSI_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^WOBURU-BUSI-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match WOBURU-BUSI-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per business rule constraining this workflow, with its logic, source, and exceptions."\n  wodepo-deci:\n    prefix: WODEPO_DECI_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^WODEPO-DECI-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match WODEPO-DECI-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per decision point, with its criteria, decision maker, possible outcomes, and escalation path."\n  woexen-exce:\n    prefix: WOEXEN_EXCE_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^WOEXEN-EXCE-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match WOEXEN-EXCE-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per exception type, with its frequency, handling procedure, escalation path, and recovery time."\n  woinen-inpu:\n    prefix: WOINEN_INPU_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^WOINEN-INPU-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match WOINEN-INPU-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per input the workflow consumes, with its source, format, and validation rules."\n  woouen-outp:\n    prefix: WOOUEN_OUTP_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^WOOUEN-OUTP-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match WOOUEN-OUTP-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per output the workflow produces, with its destination, format, and retention requirements."\n  wostis-know:\n    prefix: WOSTIS_KNOW_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^WOSTIS-KNOW-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match WOSTIS-KNOW-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per known issue with this step, noting its frequency, impact, and any current workaround."\n  wostsy-syst:\n    prefix: WOSTSY_SYST_\n    subsection-types:\n      wostsy-name:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^WOSTSY-SYST-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match WOSTSY-SYST-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per system the step uses.\n  wosuen-entr:\n    prefix: WOSUEN_ENTR_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^WOSUEN-ENTR-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match WOSUEN-ENTR-xxx\n    description: "Add one summary row per workflow capturing its type, frequency, cycle time, step counts, actors, and automation potential."\n  wotren-trig:\n    prefix: WOTREN_TRIG_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^WOTREN-TRIG-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match WOTREN-TRIG-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per trigger, with its type (event, schedule, manual, system), source, condition, and frequency."\n  wse-step-lst:\n    prefix: WSE_STEP_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      wse-step:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: "Add the workflow steps in execution order, capturing the responsible actor, inputs/outputs, and whether each is manual, automatable and error-prone. Steps are listed here once: mark a step that needs human judgment or that fails often with the corresponding flag rather than repeating it in a second list."\n  access-acce:\n    prefix: ACCESS_ACCE\n    format: access-acce-form\n    description: "The accessibility commitment and its scope, before the specific conformance"\n  acchls-chec:\n    prefix: ACCHLS_CHEC\n    format: acchls-chec-form\n    description: "How conformance is verified, as opposed to claimed."\n  accrsu-acce:\n    prefix: ACCRSU_ACCE\n    format: accrsu-acce-form\n    description: "The shape of acceptance: who signs, over what scope, in which environment,"\n  acrse-acce:\n    prefix: ACRSE_ACCE_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^ACRSE-ACCE-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match ACRSE-ACCE-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per access restriction.\n  aprec-aprv:\n    prefix: APREC_APRV_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^APREC-APRV-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match APREC-APRV-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per required sign-off (e.g. sponsor, product owner, architecture board). The document is not released until every listed approval is recorded."\n  asmre-asmp:\n    prefix: ASMRE_ASMP_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^ASMRE-ASMP-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match ASMRE-ASMP-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per assumption (ASM-NNN).\n  azlvl-leve:\n    prefix: AZLVL_LEVE_\n    subsection-types:\n      azlvl-role:\n        max-count: 1\n      azlvl-grup:\n        max-count: 1\n      azlvl-entl:\n        max-count: 1\n      azlvl-rkey:\n        max-count: 1\n      azlvl-cust:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^AZLVL-LEVE-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match AZLVL-LEVE-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per access state that has its own requirement. At least Full must be authored; Read and Disabled inherit downwards when omitted.\n  be-brea-lst:\n    prefix: BE_BREA_LST\n    subsection-types:\n      be-brea:\n        max-count: infinite\n    min-text-length: 0\n    max-text-length: 0\n    description: Add one entry per layout breakpoint.\n  behav-beha:\n    prefix: BEHAV_BEHA_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^BEHAV-BEHA-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match BEHAV-BEHA-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per behavior rule.\n  bjoen-obje:\n    prefix: BJOEN_OBJE_\n    subsection-types:\n      bj