atch RSPCH-MODI-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per responsibility being modified in the role.\n  rspch-remo:\n    prefix: RSPCH_REMO_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^RSPCH-REMO-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match RSPCH-REMO-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per responsibility being removed from the role.\n  rspdt-prim:\n    prefix: RSPDT_PRIM_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^RSPDT-PRIM-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match RSPDT-PRIM-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per primary responsibility.\n  rspdt-seco:\n    prefix: RSPDT_SECO_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^RSPDT-SECO-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match RSPDT-SECO-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per secondary responsibility.\n  rvcri-revi:\n    prefix: RVCRI_REVI_\n    subsection-types:\n      rcea:\n        max-count: 1\n      rcer:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^RVCRI-REVI-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match RVCRI-REVI-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per review criterion.\n  rvent-revs:\n    prefix: RVENT_REVS_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^RVENT-REVS-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match RVENT-REVS-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per revision, newest last. Each entry captures the version, date, author, and a short summary of what changed."\n  saclc-serv:\n    prefix: SACLC_SERV_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SACLC-SERV-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SACLC-SERV-xxx\n    format: saclc-serv-form\n    description: Add one entry per service-account lifecycle entry.\n  scbhv-beha:\n    prefix: SCBHV_BEHA_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SCBHV-BEHA-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SCBHV-BEHA-xxx\n    description: Define dynamic behaviors and interactions.\n  scbnd-scop:\n    prefix: SCBND_SCOP_\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SCBND-SCOP-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SCBND-SCOP-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per assumption that underpins the scope boundaries. State what is assumed and the impact if it proves false.\n  scmst-step:\n    prefix: SCMST_STEP_\n    subsection-types:\n      scmst-base:\n        max-count: 1\n      scmst-refd:\n        max-count: 1\n      scmst-chng:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SCMST-STEP-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SCMST-STEP-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per versioned migration artifact.\n  scnry-scen:\n    prefix: SCNRY_SCEN_\n    subsection-types:\n      scid:\n        max-count: 1\n      scco:\n        max-count: 1\n      scnst-step-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n        min-count: 1\n      alfl-alte-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n      scda:\n        max-count: 1\n      scti:\n        max-count: 1\n      scva:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SCNRY-SCEN-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SCNRY-SCEN-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per key scenario.\n  scnst-step:\n    prefix: SCNST_STEP_\n    subsection-types:\n      ssec:\n        max-count: 1\n      scstenex:\n        max-count: 1\n      svcst-step-lst:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SCNST-STEP-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SCNST-STEP-xxx\n    description: "Add one entry per main-flow step, in order."\n  scrac-item:\n    prefix: SCRAC_ITEM_\n    subsection-types:\n      saev:\n        max-count: 1\n      saec:\n        max-count: 1\n      saeb:\n        max-count: 1\n    pattern-check-id:\n      pattern: ^SCRAC-ITEM-.+\$\n      error-message: IDs of this section must match SCRAC-ITEM-xxx\n    description: Add one entry per screen action.\n  screl-elem:\n    prefix: SCREL_ELEM_\n    subsection-types:\n      seer:\n        max-count: 1\n      scelenla:\n        max-count: 1\n      seeb:\n        max-count: 1\n      azre