nts, API keys"\n      - fieldname: authorizedRoles\n        description: "Roles/teams with access, e.g. DevOps, QA, Developers"\n      - fieldname: vpnRequired\n        description: Yes / No — whether VPN/private network access is required\n      - fieldname: securityClassification\n        description: Public / Internal / Confidential / Restricted\n      - fieldname: encryptionAtRest\n        description: "AES-256, KMS key, HSM-backed — scope"\n      - fieldname: encryptionInTransit\n        description: TLS 1.3 / mTLS / VPN tunnel requirements\n      - fieldname: secretsManagement\n        description: "Vault, AWS Secrets Manager, Azure Key Vault"\n  envdm-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: dataClassification\n        description: Production / Anonymized / Synthetic / Subset / Empty\n      - fieldname: dataRefreshStrategy\n        description: "How data is populated — snapshot restore, ETL, seed scripts"\n      - fieldname: dataRefreshFrequency\n        description: Daily / Weekly / OnDemand / PerRelease\n      - fieldname: dataRetentionPolicy\n        description: "How long data is kept, archival rules"\n      - fieldname: backupStrategy\n        description: "Backup frequency, retention period, tested restore cadence"\n      - fieldname: dataResidency\n        description: Geographic/legal constraints for data storage\n  envcf-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: operatingSystem\n        description: "OS and version, e.g. Ubuntu 22.04 LTS"\n      - fieldname: runtimeVersions\n        description: "Language/framework versions, e.g. Dart 3.5, Node 20 LTS"\n      - fieldname: databaseVersions\n        description: "DB engine(s) and version(s), e.g. PostgreSQL 16, Redis 7"\n      - fieldname: middleware\n        description: "Message queues, caches, search engines, e.g. RabbitMQ 3.13"\n      - fieldname: featureFlagConfig\n        description: Environment-specific feature flag overrides\n      - fieldname: configurationMethod\n        description: Env vars / Secrets Manager / Config files / Consul\n  envav-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: uptimeRequirement\n        description: "Target availability, e.g. 99.95%"\n      - fieldname: maintenanceWindow\n        description: "Scheduled window, e.g. Sun 02:00-06:00 UTC"\n      - fieldname: slaTarget\n        description: Response/resolution times for incidents\n      - fieldname: rpo\n        description: "Max acceptable data loss, e.g. 1 hour"\n      - fieldname: rto\n        description: "Max acceptable downtime, e.g. 4 hours"\n      - fieldname: disasterRecoveryPlan\n        description: "DR strategy — warm standby, pilot light, active-active"\n  envco-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: networkZone\n        description: DMZ / Internal / Management / Restricted\n      - fieldname: firewallRules\n        description: Key inbound/outbound rules summary\n      - fieldname: integrationEndpoints\n        description: External/internal APIs this env connects to\n      - fieldname: dnsConfiguration\n        description: "DNS entries, e.g. staging.example.com -> ALB"\n      - fieldname: loadBalancer\n        description: "LB type and config, e.g. ALB with path-based routing"\n      - fieldname: serviceDiscovery\n        description: DNS-based / Service mesh / Consul / K8s Services\n  envmn-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: monitoringTools\n        description: "APM and infra monitoring, e.g. Datadog, CloudWatch"\n      - fieldname: loggingPlatform\n        description: "Centralized logging, e.g. ELK, CloudWatch Logs, Loki"\n      - fieldname: alertingConfiguration\n        description: "Alert rules, channels, thresholds, escalation"\n      - fieldname: dashboardUrl\n        description: Monitoring/status dashboard URL\n      - fieldname: healthCheckEndpoints\n        description: Health and readiness probe paths\n  envlc-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: provisioningMethod\n        description: Manual / Terraform / CloudFormation / Pulumi / Helm\n      - fieldna