y structural shifts"\n      - fieldname: designPrinciples\n        description: Guiding principles for organizational design changes\n      - fieldname: governanceChanges\n        description: Changes to decision-making authority and oversight\n      - fieldname: reportingLineChanges\n        description: Summary of reporting relationship modifications\n      - fieldname: communicationChannelChanges\n        description: New or modified formal communication flows\n      - fieldname: collaborationModelChanges\n        description: How teams will work together differently\n  ocidn-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: changeCategory\n        description: "Reporting Lines, Team Structure, Department, Division"\n      - fieldname: priority\n        description: Qualitative priority band.\n  ocscp-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: affectedArea\n        description: "Department, team, or function being changed"\n      - fieldname: currentState\n        description: How the area is currently organized\n      - fieldname: targetState\n        description: How the area will be organized after change\n      - fieldname: currentHeadcount\n        description: Number of people in current structure\n      - fieldname: targetHeadcount\n        description: Number of people in target structure\n      - fieldname: headcountDelta\n        description: Net change in headcount\n  ocrat-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: rationale\n        description: Business justification for this change\n      - fieldname: expectedBenefits\n        description: Anticipated improvements from this change\n      - fieldname: systemAlignment\n        description: How this change supports the new system\n      - fieldname: processAlignment\n        description: How this change supports new business processes\n  ocimp-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: impactLevel\n        description: Severity of disruption.\n      - fieldname: affectedRoles\n        description: Job titles impacted by this change\n      - fieldname: affectedPeople\n        description: Key individuals or groups affected\n      - fieldname: reportingLineImpact\n        description: Changes to who reports to whom\n      - fieldname: decisionRightsImpact\n        description: Changes to decision-making authority\n      - fieldname: communicationImpact\n        description: Changes to information flow\n      - fieldname: collaborationImpact\n        description: Changes to how people work together\n  octrs-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: effectiveDate\n        description: When this change takes effect\n      - fieldname: transitionPeriod\n        description: Duration of transition\n      - fieldname: transitionOwner\n        description: Person accountable for implementing\n      - fieldname: communicationRequired\n        description: Announcements and messaging needed\n      - fieldname: trainingRequired\n        description: Training or enablement needed\n      - fieldname: hrActionsRequired\n        description: "Contract changes, promotions, transfers"\n      - fieldname: itActionsRequired\n        description: "System access, email groups, org hierarchy"\n  ocsta-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: status\n        description: "Proposed, Approved, In Progress, Completed, Cancelled"\n      - fieldname: approvalRequired\n        description: Who must approve this change\n      - fieldname: approvalStatus\n        description: "Pending, Approved, Rejected"\n      - fieldname: notes\n        description: Additional context or considerations\n  troml-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: transitionDuration\n        description: "Total expected duration of the transition, expressed in weeks or months"\n      - fieldname: parallelOperationPeriod\n        description: How long old and new processes run side by side before the old ones are retired\n      - fieldname: cutoverStrategy\n        description: "How the go-live moment is planned and executed, including sequencing and timing of the switchover"\n      - fieldname: rollbackPlan\n        description: The fallback procedure to revert to the prior state if the transition fails\n  trogv-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: transitionGovernance\n        description: The oversight structure and where decision authority sits for the transition\n      - fieldname: transitionOwner\n        description: The single person or role accountable for the overall transition\n      - fieldname: changeChampions\n        description: The advocates within each affected area who champion the change and support adoption\n  tpiml-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: startDate\n        description: The planned start date for this phase\n      - fieldname: endDate\n        description: The planned end date for this phase\n      - fieldname: duration\n        description: "Expected duration of the phase, expressed in weeks"\n      - fieldname: precedingPhase\n        description: The phase that must complete before this one begins — a transition phase section id (TRPHE-PHAS-…)\n      - fieldname: dependsOnMilestone\n        description: The milestone this phase depends on before it can start — a milestone section id (TRMIL-MILE-…)\n  tpisc-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: affectedLocations\n        description: The sites or regions that fall within the scope of this phase\n      - fieldname: affectedDepartments\n        description: The organizational units or departments impacted by this phase\n      - fieldname: affectedUserCount\n        description: The number of users affected by this phase\n  tpext-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: exitCriteria\n        description: The conditions that must be satisfied for the phase to be considered complete\n      - fieldname: signOffRequired\n        description: Who must approve phase completion before moving on\n      - fieldname: qualityGates\n        description: The quality checks that must pass before the phase can close\n      - fieldname: successIndicators\n        description: The measurable outcomes that indicate the phase succeeded\n      - fieldname: knownIssuesResolution\n        description: Which outstanding items are permitted to remain unresolved at phase exit\n  tmlgv-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: deliverables\n        description: The deliverables that must be in place for the milestone to be reached\n      - fieldname: decisionRequired\n        description: The Go/No-Go or other decision that must be made at this milestone\n      - fieldname: decisionOwner\n        description: The person or role accountable for making the decision at this milestone\n  tmed-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: dependsOnPhases\n        description: The phases that must complete before this milestone can be achieved\n      - fieldname: dependsOnMilestones\n        description: The prior milestones required before this milestone can be reached\n      - fieldname: criticality\n        description: How critical this milestone is to the transition.\n  tmer-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: celebrationActivities\n        description: The recognition or celebration activities planned for achieving this milestone\n  chreov-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: assessmentMethod\n        description: "The techniques used to assess readiness: surveys, interviews, observations, or formal readiness gates"\n      - fieldname: assessmentFrequency\n        description: "How frequently readiness is re-evaluated, e.g. weekly, per phase, or at each milestone gate"\n      - fieldname: readinessOwner\n        description: The person or role accountable for tracking and reporting change readiness\n      - fieldname: minimumReadinessLevel\n        description: The minimum readiness score or level required before the transition is allowed to proceed\n      - fieldname: escalationTrigger\n        description: The conditions under which readiness concerns must be escalated to leadership\n      - fieldname: readinessTooling\n        description: "The tools, survey platforms, or instruments used to collect and analyze readiness data"\n      - fieldname: adkarFocus\n        description: "Which ADKAR dimensions (Awareness, Desire, Knowledge, Ability, Reinforcement) are the current focus and their status"\n  trcost-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: communicationStrategy\n        description: "The overarching approach to transition communications, including tone, principles, and objectives"\n      - fieldname: keyMessages\n        description: The core messages to be reinforced consistently across all communications throughout the transition\n      - fieldname: messagingOwner\n        description: The person or role that owns and approves the content of all transition communications\n      - fieldname: feedbackChannels\n        description: "The mechanisms through which stakeholders can ask questions, raise concerns, or provide feedback"\n      - fieldname: communicationCadence\n        description: "How often transition updates are issued, e.g. weekly digests or per-milestone bulletins"\n      - fieldname: brandingGuidelines\n        description: "The visual identity, naming, and branding standards applied to change communications"\n      - fieldname: languageRequirements\n        description: The languages and translation requirements needed to reach all affected audiences\n      - fieldname: accessibilityRequirements\n        description: "The accessibility considerations (formats, captions, screen reader support) communications must meet"\n  ceed-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: channel\n        description: "The channel or medium through which this event is delivered, e.g. email, intranet, in-person"\n      - fieldname: owner\n        description: The person or role responsible for preparing and delivering this event\n      - fieldname: approver\n        description: The person or role who must approve the content before it is delivered\n      - fieldname: materialsRequired\n        description: "The materials needed to deliver this event, such as slides, scripts, handouts, or recordings"\n  ceeo-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: followUpActions\n        description: "The actions to be taken after the event, such as sharing recordings or following up on questions"\n      - fieldname: successMeasure\n        description: "How the effectiveness of this communication event is measured, e.g. attendance, survey scores, reach"\n      - fieldname: status\n        description: "The current status of this event: Planned, In Preparation, Delivered, or Cancelled"\n  trsuov-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: supportModel\n        description: "How transition support is organized: tiered help desk, buddy system, floor walkers, super-users"\n      - fieldname: supportHours\n        description: The hours and days during which transition support is available to users\n      - fieldname: supportChannels\n        description: "The channels through which users can reach support: help desk, chat, in-person, phone"\n      - fieldname: supportCapacity\n        description: The expected support volumes and the staffing provisioned to meet them\n      - fieldname: supportDuration\n        description: How long the period of enhanced transition support will last before scaling back\n      - fieldname: transitionToBAU\n        description: When and how support hands over to the business-as-usual support organization\n      - fieldname: knowledgeBase\n        description: "The self-service resources (FAQs, guides, knowledge base) available to users"\n      - fieldname: superUserNetwork\n        description: The network of local super-users or champions who provide peer support in each area\n  trmeov-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: measurementApproach\n        description: "The overall approach to evaluating transition success, including data collection and analysis methods"\n      - fieldname: reportingCadence\n        description: "How often metrics are compiled and reported, e.g. weekly, monthly, per milestone"\n      - fieldname: reportingOwner\n        description: The person or role responsible for producing the metrics reports\n      - fieldname: reportingAudience\n        description: "The audience who receives the metrics reports, e.g. steering committee, sponsors, teams"\n      - fieldname: dashboardLocation\n        description: Where the metrics dashboard or reports can be viewed\n      - fieldname: baselinePeriod\n        description: The period during which the baseline values were established for comparison\n      - fieldname: targetAchievementDate\n        description: The date by which the metric targets are expected to be met\n  tmeo-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: threshold\n        description: The minimum acceptable value for this metric below which action is required\n      - fieldname: currentValue\n        description: The most recently measured value of this metric\n      - fieldname: measurementFrequency\n        description: "How often this metric is measured, e.g. daily, weekly, monthly"\n      - fieldname: dataSource\n        description: The system or source from which this metric\'s data is collected\n      - fieldname: owner\n        description: The person or role responsible for measuring and reporting this metric\n  tmes-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: status\n        description: "The current status of this metric: On Track, At Risk, Below Target, or Achieved"\n      - fieldname: trend\n        description: "The direction this metric is trending: Improving, Stable, or Declining"\n  trea-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: probability\n        description: Qualitative likelihood band that this transition risk materializes.\n      - fieldname: impact\n        description: Qualitative consequence band if the transition risk materializes.\n      - fieldname: affectedPhases\n        description: The transition phases that would be affected if this risk materializes\n      - fieldname: earlyWarningIndicator\n        description: The signals or indicators that would warn the team this risk is emerging\n  trer-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: mitigationStrategy\n        description: The planned actions to reduce the probability or impact of this risk\n      - fieldname: contingencyPlan\n        description: The fallback plan to execute if this risk materializes despite mitigation\n      - fieldname: owner\n        description: The person or role accountable for managing and monitoring this risk\n      - fieldname: status\n        description: "The current status of this risk: Active, Mitigated, Realized, or Closed"\n  jodeov-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: roleDesignApproach\n        description: Methodology used to define and structure roles\n      - fieldname: jobArchitectureModel\n        description: "Job families, levels, and career paths"\n      - fieldname: competencyModel\n        description: Framework used to define skills and competencies\n      - fieldname: gradingStructure\n        description: How roles are graded or leveled\n      - fieldname: totalRoleImpact\n        description: "Summary count of new, changed, and removed roles"\n      - fieldname: totalFteChange\n        description: Net headcount impact across all role changes\n      - fieldname: hrPartner\n        description: HR contact responsible for these role changes\n      - fieldname: unionConsiderations\n        description: Labor relations and works council impact\n      - fieldname: legalRequirements\n        description: Employment law considerations affecting role changes\n  neroid-form:\n    fields:\n      - fieldname: roleFamily\n        description: Broader job family or category this role belongs to\n      - fieldname: jobLevel\n        description: Seniority level or pay grade\n      - fieldname: rolePurpose\n        description: Core mission the role fulfils\n      - fieldname: roleJustification\n        description: 